I’m considering whether we need to run another new test. Since we've added a copy assertion to the current hanging test, I'm questioning if that was the best move. Maybe we should have a separate test focused on validation without image sampling instead. If the existing test hangs, that might not be our responsibility. To avoid complications, I think it's better to remove the copy assertion from the existing test, creating a new one to check selection stability after highlights.
